  "description": "A lightweight, high-performance .NET 10 library for parsing, creating, and comparing semantic versions according to the Semantic Versioning 2.0.0 specification. Features arbitrary-precision version numbers, automatic prerelease rank detection, multiple comparison strategies, and full JSON serialization support. Zero external dependencies.",
